{
  "id": "55",
  "title": "玄机赋",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“玄机赋”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "太极判为天地，一气分有阴阳。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-9a90dcc6c7e7c47bfbd9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日干为主，专论财官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-730c413d71f7cbf846c8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "月支取格，乃分贵贱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-ffa9815fcfb58aefd062-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "有格不正者，败。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-38c59f835c9aa2410cae-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "无格有用者，成。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-5a85d43d74cd81645251-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "有官，莫寻格局。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-7565cb258fb423d5719e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "有格局，喜官星。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-0bf1f12b78f80ad27fde-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官印财食无破，清高。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-0111d82ec2496b8fbbcf-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀伤梟刃，用之为吉。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-04d6115c5c1bde42a62a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "善恶相交，喜去杀而从善。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-93b11ad4a96ee1cafda5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "吉凶混杂，忌害吉以化凶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-7adc9dc1c93df929de0a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "有官有杀，宜身旺，制杀为奇。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-31646ac69764094ac43b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "有官有印，畏财兴，助财为祸。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-d852f36fa1996f5241e8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身强杀浅，杀运无妨。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-feac75e3cc46874b6eb2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀重身轻，制乡为福。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-8049756111eaada44a98-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身旺印多，喜行财地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-936aa72670a14cbdc767-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财多身弱，畏入财乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-7fb8dadf7daa7dfce5d2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "男逢比劫伤官，剋妻害子。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-d81c32d144f3c33df7b0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "女犯伤官偏印，丧子刑夫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-a9628fd1c76c9edb28f0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "幼失双亲，财星太重。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-965b03a2b82b21161efb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "为人孤剋，身旺无依。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-2758987bcb9cd7735907-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "年冲月令，离祖成家。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-f41f14e551420856bd4c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日破提冲，弦断再续。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-725ecbadab4c0494970c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时日对冲，伤妻剋子。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-2771eecd90e053156485-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日通月令，得祖安身。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-372cefbf5b0ad4eaf2e6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "木遇春长，遇庚辛反假为权。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-be5af76415497152645a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "火归夏生，见壬癸能为福厚。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-2374c11e2560a46cc6b3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "土逢辰戌丑未，木重成名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-56783a69be429612a1db-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金坐申酉之中，火乡发福。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-e7e3be1d54da933401bc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "水居亥子，戊己难侵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-b05aa93951baa0b2bc05-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身坐休囚，平生未济。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-c08fb7a815ef70e45dc1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身旺喜逢禄马。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-052829a7a6804e2e6502-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身弱忌见财官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-bcd2579b8ba5c37288f4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "得时俱为旺论。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-df28862621891accb027-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "失令便作衰看。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-507e5e3dbdb4394d829f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱无根，得时为旺。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-f9d7de33d57a4a206c42-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日干无气，遇劫为强。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-6e727f2eaf1d5702c93b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身弱喜印。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-5994fca11daa6f9b3e11-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "主旺宜官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-052dfec792941c56d63d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财官印綬，破则无功。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-61acdca8d10a97ae1db5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀伤梟劫，去之为福。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-062537a05edc9b7c05bf-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲乙秋生金透露，水木火运荣昌。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-eedcdf5c103ec835e841-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丙丁冬降水汪洋，火土木方贵显。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-083c154654934803cd39-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "戊己春生，西南方有救。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-99d388161bbdabe0cd50-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚辛夏长，水土运无伤。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-91ab1b1c3d4ac5fcfac4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬癸逢于土旺，金木宜荣。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-9d43c50439c0644eaece-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身弱有印，杀旺无伤；忌行财地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-4d0141fce574bae697fd-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官伤尽，行官运以无妨。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-df427cd1cdb2b5d24cdb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官用印宜去财。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-9687c23b9d902612a90d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官用财宜去印。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-2107f93b007e99156a51-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "是或，伤官财印俱彰，将何发福；身旺者用财，身弱者用印。用财去印，用印去财，方发弥福；正所谓喜者存之，憎者去之。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-de1b18b771bb46921e46-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财多身弱，身旺以为荣。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-86efb595395ed7e77775-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身旺财衰，财旺乡而发福。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-8b3bd4c495d0e808de32-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "重犯官星，只宜制伏。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-38b739ba28889da262db-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "食神叠见，须忌官乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-b2b27207e6d1b12c43d9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "顽金无火，大用不成。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-59a05b831db20160100c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "强木无金，清名难著。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-9bd38cf9f6d64ab3b3da-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "水多得土，财多蓄。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-17ea11d9d7dc759ea04c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "火焰逢波（水星），禄位高。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-36de69a69804d7109ae9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "有官有印，无破无荣。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-361cc873b4fdd4c4a0f7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "无印无官，有格取贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-ebac832fa8e5d8ebdc69-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳刃格喜偏官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-2a018f8f73a2e54b8794-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金神最宜制伏。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-851f6905510cc7be71e6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杂气财官，刑冲则发。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-8e1d085c8997944684a0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官贵太盛，旺处必倾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-f40a16626d85ab1e2c9f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身太旺，喜见财官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-bf42d9dbbda1b2adee82-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "主太柔，不宜禄马。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-3ead26d852ee0d866a30-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "旺官旺印与旺财，入墓有祸。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-5f633acdcc8a1728e335-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官食神并身旺，遇库兴灾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-05a194561051c015299f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "运贵在于支取。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-c2942ce29f2625a44ee2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "岁重向乎干求。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-c067e4d0655c780a447c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印多者，行财而发。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-671310bdec8f261e337f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财旺者，遇比何妨。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-3b2c983d104d15d9f1f8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "格清局正，富贵荣华。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-3130f6be24a28f1d4558-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印旺官旺，声名特达。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-fb254bef0e31c8ca012c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "合官，非为贵取。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-27f1f92b08f3c6b2a4c0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "合杀，莫作凶推。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-1784b7d4f68b07d7248a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "桃花带杀，喜淫奔。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-afd7bc46319c96a4cb91-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "华盖逢空，多刻剥。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-6598bd6a37818841baf0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "平生不发，八字休囚。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-1d0baa28597f4a7441c5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "一世无权，身衰遇鬼。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-8d8aeb78bba5b546e9e2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身旺者，则宜泄、宜伤。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-08497e02cd6a3385631c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身衰者，则喜扶、喜助。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-c8189cae1b1a72c60b0e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "稟中和，莫令太过不及。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-7a11a916bfcab5d06113-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若遵此法推详，祸福验如影响。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "55-602e9db525f647ed0edf-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
